100.0000
100.0000
-100.0000
-100.0000
-93.3429
-50.6346 The accuracy of the model is 92.5%, and comparing with the α array, we can see that we have only 5 misclassified or in margin points (±100, as C was declared 100 when we used LIBSVM, so α = C), and 3 points ON the margin. We have compared manually calculated results with the predicted results: Inside Margin (yellow) On Margin (green) Misclassified (red)', '[0.013302,0.008438,-0.083222,-0.028141,-0.017130,-0.018260,-0.043803,0.071874,0.010324,-0.048550,0.027455,-0.072838,0.056903,-0.022104,-0.106625,0.017827,-0.030127,-0.019270,-0.078854,0.063164,-0.005562,-0.078159,-0.021074,0.035957,0.026304,0.015151,-0.021841,-0.008661,-0.011647,-0.061872,0.035847,0.017102,0.129506,-0.001857,-0.081478,-0.006661,-0.015039,0.021670,-0.085329,0.042127,-0.035086,0.056960,0.007552,0.025439,0.071392,-0.009517,-0.033092,-0.022988,-0.060888,-0.014181,-0.106075,-0.005680,-0.034052,-0.041951,-0.031279,-0.033631,0.008051,-0.070949,-0.041888,-0.029291,0.048692,-0.040150,-0.056437,-0.015822,0.070968,-0.030593,0.088145,-0.022156,0.048073,0.109273,-0.023289,0.048079,-0.020940,-0.036252,-0.020891,0.072645,-0.060778,0.034691,0.118511,-0.068838,0.093811,-0.041746,-0.043336,-0.051537,0.004673,0.025308,0.045878,0.025067,0.020801,-0.043385,0.125758,-0.010424,-0.072742,0.016997,0.021261,0.018180,-0.034790,-0.051186,0.073375,0.136629,-0.083407,0.001325,-0.011843,-0.027830,-0.049811,-0.018356,0.056492,-0.016823,-0.020349,0.002846,0.013289,-0.020050,-0.042666,0.046611,0.029996,-0.003642,0.096136,0.032933,0.075595,0.049521,0.007970,-0.063060,0.072412,0.054405,0.103005,-0.045584,-0.018256,0.013130,0.012017,-0.099170,0.076843,-0.039592,-0.006585,0.042802,-0.026458,-0.029653,0.073157,0.043265,-0.022052,0.044991,0.011321,0.054778,0.033658,0.079208,0.024961,0.099367,-0.046415,-0.060041,0.100391,-0.035375,0.043932,-0.058369,0.036116,-0.057034,0.006108,-0.009745,0.001878,-0.012383,-0.019620,0.007952,-0.080053,0.053909,0.053899,0.003473,0.055004,0.065439,0.024118,-0.016644,0.054281,0.034256,0.090695,-0.02