[0.29994872, 0.49453184, 0.15975023, 0.04576921],
[0.00331791, 0.07513861, 0.91537572, 0.00616775],
[0.00304195, 0.12934693, 0.01993542, 0.8476757 ]]) The sum of the values in each row is equal to 1. With these values, we can understand how each word in the sentence relates to all the other words. This is called the score matrix . Next, we need to calculate the attention matrix Z : The attention matrix Z is a matrix of, for the example sentence, 4 rows, and 512 columns. Each row corresponds to the self-attention vector of the corresponding word. The self-attention mechanism is called scaled dot product attention since we are computing the dot product between the vectors Q and K and scaling the values by ( d k ). Multi-head attention mechanism For the Transformer, we are going to compute multiple attention matrices. But why do we need multiple arrays?', '[-0.080577,-0.018041,0.019844,-0.025217,-0.055390,-0.045644,0.042921,0.091213,0.054850,-0.042649,0.034049,-0.042108,0.067040,-0.015046,-0.107471,0.042384,-0.041294,0.021387,-0.114128,0.006438,0.047537,-0.085087,-0.044916,-0.021620,0.052134,0.034251,-0.057411,-0.014354,0.002627,-0.035455,0.078604,0.078943,0.122488,0.007430,-0.106380,0.021437,-0.062434,-0.031410,0.020633,0.056356,-0.039841,0.092557,0.020468,0.010733,0.049667,-0.020435,-0.071534,0.004413,-0.025227,0.004506,-0.037212,0.026962,-0.054649,-0.003530,-0.002655,0.046732,0.029924,-0.042693,-0.002084,-0.021037,0.070361,-0.021974,-0.051470,-0.003637,0.072420,-0.033759,0.045481,-0.073054,0.019937,0.083984,-0.038575,0.024898,0.016934,-0.079972,0.015251,0.042534,-0.033675,-0.020116,0.074683,-0.039724,0.059858,0.026861,-0.002512,-0.049056,0.025365,0.039551,0.084384,0.020562,0.027797,0.005589,0.063706,-0.005244,-0.153231,0.028175,0.050970,-0.000649,0.008757,-0.066071,0.045673,0.177662,-0.032857,0.019899,-0.031742,-0.022509,-0.041073,0.002739,0.021092,-0.026058,-0.119288,0.021088,0.015455,-0.010729,-0.020420,0.038881,0.049169,-0.085412,0.038840,-0.003275,0.046981,0.004847,-0.032856,0.006163,-0.014168,0.068515,0.105595,-0.104446,-0.069145,0.019317,-0.052978,-0.036420,