INSERT INTO chunks (url, title, lang, published, chunk_index, content, embedding) VALUES ('https://alexisalulema.com/es/blog/temas-avanzados-de-asyncio-mas-alla-de-lo-basico/', 'Temas Avanzados de Asyncio: Más Allá de lo Básico', 'es', '2023-09-25', 6, 'Cuando el contador llega a cero, ninguna corrutina más puede adquirir el Semáforo hasta que una de las existentes lo libere, incrementando el contador de nuevo. Uso Básico de los Semáforos Aquí tienes un ejemplo sencillo para demostrar cómo se pueden utilizar los Semáforos para limitar el acceso concurrente: import asyncio
sem = asyncio.Semaphore(2)
async def my_coroutine(id):
async with sem:
print(f"Coroutine {id} has acquired the semaphore")
await asyncio.sleep(2)
print(f"Coroutine {id} has released the semaphore")
async def main():
tasks = [my_coroutine(i) for i in range(4)]
await asyncio.gather(*tasks)
if __name__ == "__main__":
asyncio.run(main()) En este ejemplo, creamos un Semáforo con un valor inicial de 2, lo que significa que solo dos corrutinas pueden adquirirlo al mismo tiempo. La función my_coroutine adquiere el Semáforo usando async with sem: antes de proceder con su tarea. ¿Por Qué Utilizar Semáforos? Limitación de Tasa: Si estás realizando llamadas a API o haciendo web scraping, puedes usar Semáforos para limitar la tasa a la que se realizan las solicitudes. Asignación de Recursos: En escenarios donde tienes recursos limitados como conexiones de bases de datos, los Semáforos pueden ayudar a gestionar esos recursos de manera efectiva. Uso Avanzado: Web Scraping con Limitación de Tasa Consideremos un ejemplo del mundo real donde los Semáforos pueden ser increíblemente útiles: web scraping con limitación de tasa.', '[-0.052045,0.000386,-0.016243,0.028531,-0.032917,-0.027771,0.049904,0.045976,-0.070342,0.007157,0.101379,0.002932,0.077456,0.067208,0.018520,-0.052768,0.010535,0.005387,-0.073824,0.003783,0.037011,-0.078944,0.016465,-0.024670,-0.030293,-0.002406,-0.104259,-0.096668,0.020610,-0.081570,0.033468,0.019576,0.022324,-0.012496,0.008606,0.008975,-0.005620,-0.004906,-0.039787,0.050576,-0.039469,0.027718,-0.121808,0.019481,-0.001354,-0.044364,-0.039633,0.040963,-0.117328,0.060876,-0.072536,0.031277,-0.021953,-0.034880,0.015782,0.023355,-0.042325,0.007323,-0.046651,0.030916,0.075115,-0.003260,-0.062391,0.006800,0.027155,-0.084663,0.163468,0.003387,0.029549,0.025632,0.000183,-0.004954,-0.016903,0.024811,-0.013374,0.031344,0.006484,-0.015880,0.058578,-0.005966,-0.054980,0.039958,0.019408,-0.005115,0.037252,0.030472,-0.030763,-0.000578,0.029197,-0.059301,0.023215,-0.043839,-0.023772,0.100342,0.054509,0.016079,0.006880,0.063851,0.049939,0.099981,-0.079135,0.032891,-0.030464,-0.030431,0.025380,-0.047517,0.091878,-0.021299,0.049458,-0.068027,0.031056,0.011969,0.034304,-0.014837,-0.027667,0.023814,-0.019760,-0.000474,0.040656,0.078915,0.064727,-0.018754,-0.006536,0.070546,0.089366,-0.076